    "All sixteen main games, Final Fantasy to Final Fantasy XVI, as Wikipedia's Final Fantasy navigation template lists them.",
    "The games that template lists under a main game: the direct sequels (X-2, XII: Revenant Wings, IV: The After Years, XIII-2 and Lightning Returns), the remakes of III, IV and VII (the remake of VII is planned as three games, and the third is upcoming), the 2013 relaunch of XIV, and Stranger of Paradise, which builds on the first game.",
    "The Pixel Remaster collection of the first six games.",
    "A hand-picked sample of six spin-offs from different subseries and genres: Mystic Quest, Tactics, Crystal Chronicles, Crisis Core, Dissidia and Type-0. This is a sample, not a complete list."
  ],
  "excludes": [
    "Most spin-offs, including mobile games such as Record Keeper and Brave Exvius, the Chocobo and Theatrhythm games, and World of Final Fantasy.",
